{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306400/extras/2a44088fa09b56a4f15b222a03a0a58c.poster.avif?t=1763386239\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306400/extras/2a44088fa09b56a4f15b222a03a0a58c.webm?t=1763386239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306400/extras/2a44088fa09b56a4f15b222a03a0a58c.mp4?t=1763386239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Preface guidance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the third installment of the Ryukyu Hidden series and the Ryukyu Hidden Nine Ultimate Reincarnation Chapter, the game is designed with a combat system that advocates for attack and the belief that hesitation will lead to defeat. The goal is to create a sweat drenched combat experience for players in every game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306400/extras/ff2a4f106eb40b5b8ca2834191594b5f.poster.avif?t=1763386239\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306400/extras/ff2a4f106eb40b5b8ca2834191594b5f.webm?t=1763386239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306400/extras/ff2a4f106eb40b5b8ca2834191594b5f.mp4?t=1763386239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story outline</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story begins many years ago when a crystalline fragment of spirit stone suddenly appeared on the earth. It is rumored that this thing can cure a hundred diseases and regenerate nature. The rulers slaughtered extensively in order to collect more fragments, leading to separatist disputes and rampant monsters. This world seems to have become another hell. The protagonist is a member of a mysterious organization who sets foot on an ancient fortress in search of a divine artifact. They meet a group of cunning enemies and fight against the powerful enemies within the fortress, uncovering the truth behind the world's curse of decay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306400/extras/9c8aff4bae1b48a6f62416cece6a140d.poster.avif?t=1763386239\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306400/extras/9c8aff4bae1b48a6f62416cece6a140d.webm?t=1763386239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306400/extras/9c8aff4bae1b48a6f62416cece6a140d.mp4?t=1763386239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game features, integrated themes, fast-paced defense and counterattack battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ancient style is mystical and fantastical, with strange thoughts and deeds. The battles progress layer by layer, and the plot twists and turns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306400/extras/c43bad0b3e219b066037f3228835d93e.poster.avif?t=1763386239\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306400/extras/c43bad0b3e219b066037f3228835d93e.webm?t=1763386239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306400/extras/c43bad0b3e219b066037f3228835d93e.mp4?t=1763386239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect various martial arts skills and freely match your own system</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to honing their combat skills, players also need to analyze the characteristics and strategic strategies of their skill combinations. The game is designed with three sets of active and passive systems, allowing players to quickly familiarize themselves with and combine these skills to quickly defeat and suppress enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306400/extras/e020c8104013a1d2c5683d9ead8565d6.poster.avif?t=1763386239\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306400/extras/e020c8104013a1d2c5683d9ead8565d6.webm?t=1763386239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306400/extras/e020c8104013a1d2c5683d9ead8565d6.mp4?t=1763386239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multi branch plot and ending</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game adopts a multi branch plot mode, where the order of defeating each branch will affect the original boss or plot structure, resulting in slightly different changes in the plot and drops. Increasing efforts to explore treasures and adventures can greatly reduce the difficulty of facing enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has a rich combination of skill strategies, a thrilling storyline, and dozens of different mechanisms of enemies.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u5f02\u754c\uff1a\u6d41\u5bc7\u65ad\u5200","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3306400/dba4f8baa57057ede13ab2e6800a024dfc3b210d.jpg"},{"name":"\u5f02\